            <ArticleTitle>Intrapulmonary cystic benign teratoma: a case report and review of the literature.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>290-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a 41-year-old woman with a short history of retrosternal chest pain and non-productive cough due to a benign intrapulmonary teratoma originating from the left upper lobe. The clinical, CT features of this rare tumor are presented and the relevant literature is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
